      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lai_Chi_Kok"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Qing government set up a customs station here to collect duties after Hong Kong was ceded to Britain.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lai_Chi_Kok"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jao Tsung‑I Academy, a Grade III historic building, sits on the former Lai Chi Kok Hospital, once a quarantine and psychiatric centre.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        8,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
