      ],
      "source": "https://e-cgo.org.hk/travel/en/trip-detail?id=48"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mei Foo Sun Chuen, the largest housing estate in Hong Kong with 99 blocks, anchors the neighbourhood’s residential life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
